      "date": "2026-02-03T11:28:07.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues exceed analyst expectations",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.08 (up from ₹1.52 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹5.94b (up 15% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹636.8m (up 37% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (up from 9.0% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 3.3%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 15%. Revenue is forecast to grow 13% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Luxury industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 6% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 10% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
